(
F5 T4 U8: geometry_moving in 3D with a -geometry_hexahedral that moves into a hex8 and a tet4.
The box x -2..-0.5, y -1..5, z -1..2 translates with velocity 1 0 0 from time 0 to 1 {ntime 4: right face at x -0.5 -0.25 0 0.25 0.5 at the moments 0 0.25 0.5 0.75 1}: it sweeps x up to 0.5.
geometry_moving_n 4 40: element 1, unit hex8, 40 x 40 x 40 cell midpoints, half of them with x below 0.5: part 0.5, entry times 0.5 {x up to 0.25} and 0.75.
Element 2: tet4 0,3,0 1,3,0 0,4,0 0,3,1, analytic part 1 - 0.5^3 = 0.875; the 64000 collapsed cube cell midpoints give 0.87579 {checked within 2.e-3}: geometry_hexahedral accepts points up to 1.e-3 outside in isoparametric units {point_el}, about 7.5e-4 in x here.
By the same tolerance the tet points with x below 7.5e-4 are inside at the moment 0.5: entry times 0.25 and 0.75.
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0. 0. 0.
node 2 1. 0. 0.
node 3 0. 1. 0.
node 4 1. 1. 0.
node 5 0. 0. 1.
node 6 1. 0. 1.
node 7 0. 1. 1.
node 8 1. 1. 1.
node 11 0. 3. 0.
node 12 1. 3. 0.
node 13 0. 4. 0.
node 14 0. 3. 1.
element 1 -hex8 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8
element 2 -tet4 11 12 13 14
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1.e4
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
geometry_moving 1 -geometry_hexahedral
geometry_moving_parameter 1 -2. -1. -1.  -0.5 -1. -1.  -2. 5. -1.  -0.5 5. -1.  -2. -1. 2.  -0.5 -1. 2.  -2. 5. 2.  -0.5 5. 2.
geometry_moving_operat 1 -translate
geometry_moving_operat_parameter 1 1. 0. 0.
geometry_moving_operat_time 1 0. 1.
geometry_moving_n 1 4 40
control_geometry_moving 5 -initialise
end_data
